<title>USA: Morrow Snowboards approves share buyback.</title>
<headline>Morrow Snowboards approves share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>SALEM, Ore. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morrow Snowboards Inc said Monday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to five percent of its common stock in the open market.</p>
<p>&quot;Morrow's 1996 results will be well ahead of 1995 levels, and the company's stock represents an excellent value,&quot; Chief Executive Officer David Calapp said in a statement.</p>
</text>
